Thought: We are given a set of numbers from 1 to 3n and we need to divide them into n disjoint triples. Each triple must have a specific pattern where b-a and c-b are different numbers from the set {n-1, n, n+1}. We will use run_python to solve this problem by iterating over all possible combinations and checking if they satisfy the given conditions.
Action: run_python
